-product.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.factorization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.factorization","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L86-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.traceValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.traceValue","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L85-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.chains","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.chains","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L84-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.z_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.z_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L83-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.z","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L82-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.q","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L81-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.n","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L80-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct.mk","kind":"ctor","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceProduct","kind":"structure","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L77-L87","doc":"The product factorization of the Markov trace as a structure\nrecord (existence form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.chainProduct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.chainProduct","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L69-L73","doc":"The product of vertex volumes over a chain list, defined\nrecursively to mirror the cons-form Markov axiom. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.trace_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.trace_cons","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.trace_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.trace_nil","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.trace","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms.mk","kind":"ctor","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L63-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceAxioms","kind":"class","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L61-L67","doc":"**Markov-trace axioms** (cons form, equivalent to the snoc form\nunder commutativity of `R_q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.vertexVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.vertexVolume","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceProduct.lean#L53-L57","doc":"The vertex volume at generator σ_i:\n`V̂_i(q) = z · a_i + b_i`\nwhere z = 1/(q^{1/2} + q^{-1/2}) is the Markov trace parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.GeneratorChain.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.GeneratorChain.b","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/